ORIGINAL WORK NOTICE

This project is a Flipper Zero port of "MicroTD - Tower Defense Game for
Arduboy" by Miloslav "drummyfish" Ciz (2018), released by its author under
CC0 1.0 Universal (public domain dedication). CC0 places no restrictions on
relicensing derivative works.

game/microtd.cpp is derived from that original and stays under CC0, together
with the port changes made to it, so the game code remains public domain.

The MIT license above applies to everything else in this repository: the
Flipper Zero application shell, the renderer, the build files and assets.
